  "description": "This place is within the game world.  \nWe are NPCs.  \nThe day that we become aware of this, we become a ‘bug’.  \nIf Operators catch NPCs that become ‘Bug”, they would become ‘Patch’.  \nIf you wish to survive, follow the tracks that are hidden in the field and get onto that ‘Train’!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/56939012), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%B2%84%EA%B7%B8-%ED%8A%B8%EB%A0%88%EC%9D%B8/3740)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/175472)",
